    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/extras/d2e68e8ae02011d8cfd023d3b5d65d72.avif?t=1753253817\" width=242 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A short visual novel about fear, choice, miracle, adventure, friendship, love. A game for one warm, dreamy evening with a cup of tea and cookies. At the beginning of the story, a small surprise awaits in the form of a mini-platformer to find out what happens next.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/extras/d1c97545a47193eefa011aaf2635dc6d.avif?t=1753253817\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game is based on the story &quot;Twilight&quot; by Sveta Sky.</i><br><i>Images, backgrounds, characters, styles are created by artificial intelligence.</i><br><i>Translation into other languages \u200b\u200bis done manually using a translator.</i><br><i>The developer, the author of the text is Sveta Sky.</i><br><i>The game is created on the Ren'Py engine.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/extras/e94b1cb6d3426090190202826dbb55f0.avif?t=1753253817\" width=400 height=400 /></span><i></i><br><i>The base language is Russian. The translation may contain untranslatable variables.</i><br><i>The visual novel also includes a small platformer mini-game in Python.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Detailed information about free publicly available assets can be found in the description in the game itself, as well as in the game folder. </i><br><i>To start learning the story, the player must grant victory to the zombies. </i><br><i>The game contains sounds, backgrounds, melodies that may cause anxiety.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/extras/a6b1c2edde0bb90326ced7aa8a37f6a6.avif?t=1753253817\" width=400 height=400 /></span><i></i><br><i>It is recommended to play in silence, without unnecessary background noise, at night for a greater effect.</i><br><i>The novella takes from 2 to 4 hours to complete.</i><br><i>Immerse yourself in a short story on a warm evening!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/extras/d2e68e8ae02011d8cfd023d3b5d65d72.avif?t=1753253817\" width=242 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A short visual novel about fear, choice, miracle, adventure, friendship, love. A game for one warm, dreamy evening with a cup of tea and cookies. At the beginning of the story, a small surprise awaits in the form of a mini-platformer to find out what happens next.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/extras/d1c97545a47193eefa011aaf2635dc6d.avif?t=1753253817\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game is based on the story &quot;Twilight&quot; by Sveta Sky.</i><br><i>Images, backgrounds, characters, styles are created by artificial intelligence.</i><br><i>Translation into other languages \u200b\u200bis done manually using a translator.</i><br><i>The developer, the author of the text is Sveta Sky.</i><br><i>The game is created on the Ren'Py engine.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/extras/e94b1cb6d3426090190202826dbb55f0.avif?t=1753253817\" width=400 height=400 /></span><i></i><br><i>The base language is Russian. The translation may contain untranslatable variables.</i><br><i>The visual novel also includes a small platformer mini-game in Python.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Detailed information about free publicly available assets can be found in the description in the game itself, as well as in the game folder. </i><br><i>To start learning the story, the player must grant victory to the zombies. </i><br><i>The game contains sounds, backgrounds, melodies that may cause anxiety.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/extras/a6b1c2edde0bb90326ced7aa8a37f6a6.avif?t=1753253817\" width=400 height=400 /></span><i></i><br><i>It is recommended to play in silence, without unnecessary background noise, at night for a greater effect.</i><br><i>The novella takes from 2 to 4 hours to complete.</i><br><i>Immerse yourself in a short story on a warm evening!</i></p>",
